;   $8000-$81FF  MenuStreamPtrTable   256 x .word, index = pos id
;   $8200-$9AE2  MenuStreamArea       170 display-list streams, packed
;   $9AE3-$9EE2  NewGameBaseScreen    1 KB nametable image -> PPU $2000
